<p>Explaining things generally makes them less compelling instead of more compelling, but I'll give it a shot anyway. The reason it's a Saturday morning cartoon is because pretty much everyone has some good memories about Saturday morning cartoons. There's nothing quite like subverting a sunny memory to unnerve people.</p>
